WEBVTT

00:00:04.305 --> 00:00:09.502
A Journey around Uluru

00:01:01.376 --> 00:01:04.283
In the center of Australia lies Uluru,

00:01:04.404 --> 00:01:06.887
the great Swayambhu of Shri Ganesha.

00:01:08.521 --> 00:01:12.441
At this sacred place, Uluru is accompanied by Atila and Kata Tjuta,

00:01:12.562 --> 00:01:15.745
two other great geological formations.

00:01:25.008 --> 00:01:28.688
Atila, 200 million years older than Uluru,

00:01:28.809 --> 00:01:31.592
is a monolith shaped like a bandhan,

00:01:31.713 --> 00:01:36.073
and rises 300 m above the plain, 100 km east of Uluru.

00:01:46.957 --> 00:01:49.667
According to the pre-ancestral stories,

00:01:49.788 --> 00:01:52.937
it is a place created for man out of ice.

00:01:53.058 --> 00:01:55.432
So, the home of the "ice people."

00:01:55.553 --> 00:01:58.782
It is the place of Shri Sadashiva...

00:01:59.189 --> 00:02:01.942
Kata Tjuta, a group of enormous stone domes,

00:02:02.063 --> 00:02:04.507
is located 27 km west of Uluru.

00:02:04.628 --> 00:02:08.260
Its highest peak reaches 545 m above the plain.

00:02:10.715 --> 00:02:13.980
This traditionally sacred place is the setting

00:02:14.123 --> 00:02:17.208
of the creation stories of the Great Serpent.

00:02:17.329 --> 00:02:20.409
It is the dwelling of the female ancestors...

00:02:30.129 --> 00:02:33.085
Uluru, the second largest monolith in the world,

00:02:33.206 --> 00:02:35.650
rises 318 m above the plain,

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:38.064
is 8 km in circumference,

00:02:38.185 --> 00:02:41.157
and extends 2.5 km into the ground.

00:02:50.371 --> 00:02:53.591
At dawn on August 14, 2005, we made our pilgrimage

00:02:53.712 --> 00:02:57.704
by walking around its base in a clockwise direction.

00:03:08.711 --> 00:03:12.365
Uluru is the site of important Aboriginal ceremonies

00:03:12.486 --> 00:03:15.138
that we did not photograph,

00:03:15.259 --> 00:03:18.927
in accordance with the wishes of its traditional owners.

00:12:32.746 --> 00:12:35.142
To the traditional owners of this land,

00:12:35.263 --> 00:12:36.562
the Anangu,

00:12:36.683 --> 00:12:38.483
their land was returned in 1985

00:12:38.604 --> 00:12:40.604
by the Australian government.

00:12:47.877 --> 00:12:50.608
Please, do not climb Uluru.

00:13:08.485 --> 00:13:12.287
It is a truly important, sacred place that you are climbing.

00:13:12.487 --> 00:13:15.950
You should not. It is not something to be done."

00:13:16.088 --> 00:13:18.545
Kunmanara, Traditional Owner.

00:13:28.914 --> 00:13:31.469
Shri Ganesha, may I be worthy of Your attention.

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:35.336
Please make me innocent, so that I may be worthy of Your attention.

00:13:35.457 --> 00:13:37.677
Shri Mataji, You who are Shri Ganesha,

00:13:37.798 --> 00:13:40.514
please grant me wisdom and discernment."

00:13:40.635 --> 00:13:42.235
"Shri Mataji Nirmala Devi
